From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tangudu Tilak Tirumalesh <tilak.tirumalesh.tangudu@intel.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 06:49:03 +0530
Subject: [TEMP] drm/xe: Extend Wa_16030224309 to graphics version 35.11

Opt in to the GuC workaround that ignores context completion status
with preemption or preemption-to-idle in the CSB when the multi-queue
feature is enabled, on Graphics Version 35.11 as well.
This WA is supported starting from GuC 70.73.

Assisted-by: GitHub_Copilot:claude-sonnet-5
Signed-off-by: Tangudu Tilak Tirumalesh <tilak.tirumalesh.tangudu@intel.com>

Reviewed-by: Niranjana Vishwanathapura <niranjana.vishwanathapura@intel.com>

(Backported from https://patchwork.freedesktop.org/patch/761238/?series=176414&rev=1)
Signed-off-by: S A Muqthyar Ahmed <syed.abdul.muqthyar.ahmed@intel.com>
Signed-off-by: SYS SEOS AUTOBACKPORT <sys_seos_autobackport@intel.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_wa_oob.rules | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_wa_oob.rules b/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_wa_oob.rules
index 6e2272582a04..f441b1f1b125 100644
